# Trees OpenWiki must not scan. Each is either superseded, generated, or a
# local cache, so documenting it would describe something that is not the
# current state of this repository.

# Superseded documents, kept as evidence only.
archive/**

# Generated HTML mirrors of docs/. hx-render-html owns them; they carry no
# information the Markdown does not.
human-html/**

# Local code-graph cache. Git-ignored, rebuilt per machine.
graft/**

# Harness configuration, not repository content.
.claude/**

# Repository automation. Excluded so the documentation agent does not describe
# or edit CI configuration.
#
# This exclusion is NOT what keeps .github/workflows/openwiki-update.yml
# deleted, and an earlier comment here claimed that it was. This file governs
# the documentation agent's own reads and writes. The workflow is written by
# OpenWiki's setup path, which never consults it, and only by `openwiki init`.
# D-030 is the control: init is not run here. HX7-F01 has the evidence.
.github/**
